# What `gcloud run deploy --source .` uploads to Cloud Build.
#
# This file matters more than it looks: mechanical/ alone is 3.2 GB of CAD and
# STLs. Without it every deploy would upload the lot, and gcloud's fallback —
# inferring the upload set from .gitignore — would still ship ~120 MB of
# firmware and printable parts that the container has no use for.
#
# Exclude every top-level entry...
/*

# ...then add back only what the build reads. Re-including whole directories
# rather than globs inside them is deliberate: gitignore semantics cannot
# re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
!/Dockerfile
!/.dockerignore
!/server
!/docs

.DS_Store
